            "review_text": "Trung N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nVery nice\nJul 2024 • Friends\nIt's an interesting place with a memorable experience of taking q boat across the river, which is quite special in SaiGon. You must try the \"Mangosteen chicken salad\" which is \"Gỏi gà tre măng cụt\" in vietnamese\nWritten July 24, 2024",
