            "review_title": "Review at Food Village Cu Lao Xanh",
            "review_text": "Stephanie C\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam98 contributions\n0\nFun and relaxed setting. Great playground for kids\nFeb 2019 • Family\nThis is a short hop on a boat just opposite Starbucks at Panorama. We love going here with our toddler as there is a playground so she can play while we eat. Tanks full of fish and extensive menu. Staff have limited English but the menu is in English so you can just point. Always a good evening\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 18, 2019",
