            "review_title": "Review at Food Village Cu Lao Xanh",
            "review_text": "Jan F\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam56 contributions\n0\nfun lunch in the afternoon\nNov 2018\nWe had a nice lunch here the other day, nice short ride across the river to the restaurant, a seafood place we had clams, fried rice, fried squid for me, soup, and a salad that I'm not sure what it was called, but it had pig ears in it. I usually have squid, shrimp or clams as the fish in most of the restaurants, and whatever is in the river. We had a nice quiet lunch with friends and family it rained while we were there and we just moved our table back into the restaurant, it was an enjoyable afternoon and the short ride to and from the restaurant was fun.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 4, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
