            "review_text": "Grantwatson777\nAdelaide, Australia1114 contributions\n0\nFabulous food\nMar 2018 • Friends\nOnly accessible by free boat ride across river. Had a fabulous late lunch with starter of steamed vegetable and rice. Then followed up by seafood hot pot. My first hot pot and I will definitely do that again, it was so delicious. Final course was a local fried fish which was cooked to perfection.\nThe service was very quick and friendly they made sure we weren’t kept waiting for drinks.\nThe prices are very reasonable at 1,000,000 dong for a 3 course banquet and beers.\nRead more\nWritten March 29, 2018",
