            "review_text": "desiremmwekb10\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2964 contributions\n0\nExtraordinary view island-like restaurant\nNov 2017 • Family\nThe restaurant has a unique location, on the other side of PMH river bank. The only way to get to the restaurant is by boat. You can catch the boat in front of Panorama building. Outdoor seating is very nice. At night, the view back to the crowded PMH is very beautiful. The food is good, not too impressive but enjoyable. It's perfect to have small party or family get together here. Just to change the scenery and being outside looking in to the normal life is amazing.\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2017",
